<title>UK: Rank up on reports of disposal progress.</title>
<headline>Rank up on reports of disposal progress.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Rank Organisation climbed 13-1/2p to 460p by 1238 GMT on weekend press reports that the leisure group's planned disposal was getting under way, traders said.</p>
<p>The Sunday Times, predicting an advance in Rank's shares, said Rank would soon make an announcement regarding the sale of Precision Industries.</p>
<p>The sale is the first part of a 300 million stg disposal programme.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
